{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/450c3a44728c2b73bbf27c6f60c7ec9d.avif?t=1759325830\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a deep, engaging experience with an immersive narrative, so pay attention to your surroundings.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The current DEMO does not represent the actual state of the project. A brand new demo with revamp on graphics and game design will be available for Halloween!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f No AI was used for art, sound design or development in this game. Every aspect crafted by human hands and creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/b090f1a6a1fb5cc5e2e0e538865bcfb0.avif?t=1759325830\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who Are You!? is a sci-fi psychological horror game, where you'll face the unknown in order to save your family.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/98e18ed76a5ead512bb1ab35d69caef0.webp?t=1759325830\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/be04c112f0a7c390223b49ab9c7037c0.avif?t=1759325830\" width=600 height=186 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Research Collaboration Notice</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who Are You!? is developed with the support and insights of renowned Argentine ufologists Silvia and Andrea P\u00e9rez Simondini.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silvia is a pioneering UFO researcher, founder of the UFO Museum in Victoria, Entre R\u00edos, and director of the research group Visi\u00f3n OVNI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Andrea is Director of CEFORA and South America Continental Director for ICER, recognized internationally for her work on UAPs and anomalous phenomena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their real-world investigations and knowledge have helped shape the game's narrative and authenticity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/a3db0cda9a2731905c5d44fc225a616b.webp?t=1759325830\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep narrative based on true ufology stories and investigations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emotional and psychological interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/9931786de648ebf6d1afa0cf57dbfbcc.webp?t=1759325830\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The story follows Ray Roswell, who lost his wife 20 years ago. Now, his only daughter has gone missing. In his search for her, Ray not only embarks on a physical journey but also confronts the emotional and psychological trauma of his past, reliving the pain he has tried to forget.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2646450?t=1759325830","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/05b8982eb0dbade1397451879282fc7c4d1ac12f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759325830","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/0c7da8214cc5d1880f6d65cb7a742cfa9498a184/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759325830","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/0c7da8214cc5d1880f6d65cb7a742cfa9498a184/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759325830","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Corpses, Blood, General Mature Content"},"demos":[{"appid":2648320,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/450c3a44728c2b73bbf27c6f60c7ec9d.avif?t=1759325830\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a deep, engaging experience with an immersive narrative, so pay attention to your surroundings.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The current DEMO does not represent the actual state of the project. A brand new demo with revamp on graphics and game design will be available for Halloween!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f No AI was used for art, sound design or development in this game. Every aspect crafted by human hands and creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/b090f1a6a1fb5cc5e2e0e538865bcfb0.avif?t=1759325830\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who Are You!? is a sci-fi psychological horror game, where you'll face the unknown in order to save your family.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/98e18ed76a5ead512bb1ab35d69caef0.webp?t=1759325830\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/be04c112f0a7c390223b49ab9c7037c0.avif?t=1759325830\" width=600 height=186 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Research Collaboration Notice</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who Are You!? is developed with the support and insights of renowned Argentine ufologists Silvia and Andrea P\u00e9rez Simondini.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silvia is a pioneering UFO researcher, founder of the UFO Museum in Victoria, Entre R\u00edos, and director of the research group Visi\u00f3n OVNI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Andrea is Director of CEFORA and South America Continental Director for ICER, recognized internationally for her work on UAPs and anomalous phenomena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their real-world investigations and knowledge have helped shape the game's narrative and authenticity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/a3db0cda9a2731905c5d44fc225a616b.webp?t=1759325830\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep narrative based on true ufology stories and investigations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emotional and psychological interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/9931786de648ebf6d1afa0cf57dbfbcc.webp?t=1759325830\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The story follows Ray Roswell, who lost his wife 20 years ago. Now, his only daughter has gone missing. In his search for her, Ray not only embarks on a physical journey but also confronts the emotional and psychological trauma of his past, reliving the pain he has tried to forget.</p>","developers":["Haunting Humans Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/3b383b076763ebc756dd2b70bcb999d639ccc045/header.jpg?t=1759325830","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2646450/1462660147/d0c2f3258863cd331fc056ba81b82a2b1fcb99d9/1759263457/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759264575","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2646450/1462660147/d0c2f3258863cd331fc056ba81b82a2b1fcb99d9/1759263457/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759264575","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2646450/1462660147/d0c2f3258863cd331fc056ba81b82a2b1fcb99d9/1759263457/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759264575","id":257209611,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257209611/movie480.mp4?t=1759264575","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257209611/movie_max.mp4?t=1759264575"},"name":"Who Ar